## Error Handling

Always use try-catch and pass errors to next():

```javascript
const handler = async (req, res, next) => {
  try {
    // Implementation
  } catch (error) {
    next(error); // Handled by src/core/middleware/errorHandler.js
  }
};
```

## External API Integration

When adding new external API:

1. Create file in `screener-api/src/core/api/`
2. Document API details (base URL, auth, rate limits) in `docs/<provider>-api-schemas.md`
3. Add caching if appropriate
4. Add tests in `screener-api/src/core/api/__tests__/`

## Environment Variables

Document new env vars in:
- `.env.example` (root of repo — single shared `.env`, not per-workspace)
- `docs/API_REFERENCE.md` (per-endpoint auth requirements)

## Testing Checklist

- [ ] Unit tests for controller functions
- [ ] Edge case tests (null, empty, error)
- [ ] Mock external dependencies
- [ ] Test file in `__tests__/` folder next to source
